        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vitas Gerulaitis, Heather Watson\n- Events: 1978 Australian Open – Men's Singles\n- Roles: American professional tennis player, British tennis player, Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion\n\nFacts:\n- Vitas Gerulaitis, born Vytautas Kevin Gerulaitis on July 26, 1954, was an American professional tennis player.\n- Heather Watson, born Heather Miriam Watson on May 19, 1992, is a British tennis player and a Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion.\n- Vitas Gerulaitis was the defending champion for the 1978 Australian Open – Men's Singles, but he did not compete that year.\n- Vitas Gerulaitis died on September 17, 1994.",
